"int bits) :ref:`🔗<shader_func_bitfieldExtract>`"
msgstr ""
"|vec_uint_type| **bitfieldExtract**\\ (\\ |vec_uint_type| 값, int 오프셋, "
"int 비트) :ref:`🔗<shader_func_bitfieldExtract>`"

